    "InsertKoinIO/koin: 434 of the 2590 file-edge truth pairs are same-package references no import statement writes (the dump's same_package entries: a file reaching a top-level name of its own package, which the language lets it do with no import; LB-F433, O519); they score file_edge_precision and file_edge_recall and never import_resolution",
